# Named arg with field annotation in a Call bracket (T-1052)
# [Ctor fields@Child: val] where Ctor is an uppercase name in head position
# → Priority 3 (Call frame). fields@Child sets pending_key with annotation.
# The annotation is stored in SurfaceNamedArg.annotation (not displayed).
# Display shows name: value (annotation stripped in display output).
# This form is used for runtime constructor calls, not type declarations.
[Union types@Child: "values"]
=== out
[Union types: "values"]
